<title>USA: Harcourt assumes NEC subord debt obligations.</title>
<headline>Harcourt assumes NEC subord debt obligations.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harcourt General Inc said Thursday it had assumed all obligations of the 6 1/2 percent convertible subordinated debt due 2011 of its National Education Corp subsidiary.</p>
<p>Harcourt General said there is currently outstanding $54.55 million of the debentures, which are subject to a mandatory annual redemption of $2.875 million in principal amount.</p>
<p>It said the debentures would continue to be listed on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
